# Bug 6: config_mvin rs1[4:3] picks one of 3 load pipelines (mvin, mvin2, mvin3), each
# with its own stride, scale and shrunk flag. The old ILA keeps one shared set.
# Configure mvin (pipeline 0) with stride 16, then mvin2 (pipeline 1) with stride 32,
# then mvin 2 rows.
# Where: src/gemmini.cc:294-298, config_mvin writes one shared acc_type, private_stride,
#   memory_stride_mvin and scale; mvin_type (rs1[4:3], line 295) is stored but never read.
#   Missing: one set of these registers per load pipeline.
# Spec: README.md:411-412 (mvin2 and mvin3 have "their own independent set of configuration
#   registers") and 467 (config_mvin rs1[4:3] picks the pipeline). RTL LoadController.scala:33-37
#   (stride, scale, shrink per load state), 61-64 (state from funct or rs1[4:3]), 143-146.
# Expected: mvin uses stride 16, so scratchpad row 1 col 0 = 0x22 = 34.
# Old ILA: uses the last stride, 32, so row 1 col 0 = 0x33 = 51.
config funct=0 rs1=0x3f80000000100001 rs2=0x0000000000000010
config funct=0 rs1=0x3f80000000100009 rs2=0x0000000000000020
.mem 0x10000 11
.mem 0x10010 22
.mem 0x10020 33
mvin   funct=2 rs1=0x0000000000010000 rs2=0x0002000100000000
